== exit: 0
== stdout:
== a separator that is not one character raises with a period ==
hexlify sep b'::' => ValueError : sep must be length 1.
hexlify sep b'' => ValueError : sep must be length 1.
hexlify sep '::' => ValueError : sep must be length 1.
b2a_hex sep b'::' => ValueError : sep must be length 1.
bytes.hex sep '::' => ValueError : sep must be length 1.
bytearray.hex sep '::' => ValueError : sep must be length 1.
== a single-character separator is accepted ==
hexlify sep b':' => b'61:62:63:64'
hexlify sep b':' bytes 2 => b'6162:6364'
b2a_hex sep 'x' => b'61x62'
hexlify sep b'\xff' => b'61\xff62'
bytes.hex sep ':' bytes 2 => '6162:6364'
== exception:
